      ],
      "z_order_recursive": 28,
      "local_bounds_emu": [
        1285874,
        1056165,
        9620252,
        301041
      ],
      "text_preview": "围绕流动性、交易延迟、安全与合规四类问题拆解去中心化交易痛点",
      "typography_role": "chinese_body"
    },
    {
      "shape_id": 26,
      "shape_name": "Text 3",
      "shape_type": 1,
      "group_path": [],
      "z_order_recursive": 29,
      "local_bounds_emu": [
        1023040,
        2690317,
        4112262,
        393822
      ]
    },
    {
      "shape_id": 27,
      "shape_name": "Text 6",
      "shape_type": 1,
      "group_path": [],
      "z_order_recursive": 30,
      "local_bounds_emu": [
        1244718,
        1958186,
        3262432,
        461665
      ],
      "text_preview": "流动性碎片化与高滑点",
      "typography_role": "chinese_heading"
    },
    {
      "shape_id": 144,
      "shape_name": "Text 7",
      "shape_type": 1,
      "group_path": [],
      "z_order_recursive": 31,
      "local_bounds_emu": [
        1244718,
        2402478,
        3863668,
        1046627
      ],
      "text_preview": "DEX的流动性通常分散在多个独立的资金池中，导致大额交易面临较高的滑点。例如，XBIT研究报告指出，主流DEX的大额交易（10万美元以上）平均滑点达3.2%，而",
      "typography_role": "chinese_body"
    },
    {
      "shape_id": 145,
      "shape_name": "Text 10",
      "shape_type": 1,
      "group_path": [],
      "z_order_recursive": 32,
      "local_bounds_emu": [
        7043752,
        1922090,
        3262432,
        461665
      ],
      "text_preview": "交易延迟与价格漂移",
      "typography_role": "chinese_heading"
    },
    {
      "shape_id": 146,
      "shape_name": "Text 11",
      "shape_type": 1,
      "group_path": [],
      "z_order_recursive": 33,
      "local_bounds_emu": [
        7043753,
        2402478,
        3973213,
        1211226
      ],
      "text_preview": "DEX依赖自动做市商（AMM）机制，价格更新较慢，容易受到套利机器人的攻击（MEV问题）。例如，XBIT的研究发现，套利机器人可能吞噬用户0.3%-1.2%的预",
      "typography_role": "chinese_body"
    },
    {
      "shape_id": 147,
      "shape_name": "Text 14",
      "shape_type": 1,
      "group_path": [],
      "z_order_recursive": 34,
      "local_bounds_emu": [
        1244718,
        4413915,
        3262432,
        461665
      ],
      "text_preview": "安全性风险",
      "typography_role": "chinese_heading"
    },
    {
      "shape_id": 148,
      "shape_name": "Text 15",
      "shape_type": 1,
      "group_path": [],
      "z_order_recursive": 35,
      "local_bounds_emu": [
        1244719,
        4907601,
        4001424,
        1046627
      ],
      "text_preview": "尽管DEX强调非托管资产安全，但智能合约漏洞仍是一个重大威胁。例如，币安近期警告用户警惕DEX上的“异常高收益率”项目，这些项目可能隐藏结构性风险或欺诈行为。\n",
      "typography_role": "chinese_body"
    },
    {
      "shape_id": 149,
      "shape_name": "Text 18",
      "shape_type": 1,
      "group_path": [],
      "z_order_recursive": 36,
      "local_bounds_emu": [
        7043752,
        4413915,
        3262432,
        461665
      ],
      "text_preview": "监管合规挑战",
      "typography_role": "chinese_heading"
    },
    {
      "shape_id": 150,
      "shape_name": "Text 19",
      "shape_type": 1,
      "group_path": [],
      "z_order_recursive": 37,
      "local_bounds_emu": [
        7043753,
        4907601,
        4125208,
        1046627
      ],
      "text_preview": "SEC等监管机构已明确表示，代币化资产仍需遵守证券法，这对DEX上的某些交易对（如股票代币化）构成合规障碍。\n部分DEX因缺乏KYC（了解你的客户）机制，可能被",
      "typography_role": "chinese_body"
    },
